## 6. 第五步：生成便携版 zip

新增：

```text
tools/package_portable_zip.bat
```

内容参考：

```bat
@echo off
setlocal

set "ROOT=%~dp0.."
set "VERSION=0.9.1"
set "DIST=%ROOT%\dist"
set "APPDIR=%DIST%\SimpleScopePC"
set "ZIP=%DIST%\SimpleScopePC-%VERSION%-win64-portable.zip"

if not exist "%APPDIR%\SimpleScopePC.exe" (
  echo Missing portable app. Run tools\build_portable.bat first.
  exit /b 1
)

if exist "%ZIP%" del "%ZIP%"

powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -Command ^
  "Compress-Archive -Path '%APPDIR%\*' -DestinationPath '%ZIP%' -Force"

echo Created %ZIP%
exit /b 0
