## 8. 第七步：GitHub Actions 自动打包 Release

新增：

```text
.github/workflows/release-windows.yml
```

内容参考：

```yaml
name: Build Windows Release

on:
  push:
    tags:
      - "v*"

permissions:
  contents: write

jobs:
  build-windows:
    runs-on: windows-latest

    steps:
      - name: Checkout
        uses: actions/checkout@v4

      - name: Set up Python
        uses: actions/setup-python@v5
        with:
          python-version: "3.11"

      - name: Install dependencies
        shell: pwsh
        run: |
          python -m pip install -U pip
          python -m pip install -e .[dev]

      - name: Run tests
        shell: pwsh
        run: |
          python -m pytest -q

      - name: Build portable app
        shell: cmd
        run: |
          tools\build_portable.bat

      - name: Create portable zip
        shell: pwsh
        run: |
          $version = "${{ github.ref_name }}".TrimStart("v")
          Compress-Archive -Path "dist\SimpleScopePC\*" -DestinationPath "dist\SimpleScopePC-$version-win64-portable.zip" -Force

      - name: Upload GitHub Release assets
        uses: softprops/action-gh-release@v2
        with:
          files: |
            dist/SimpleScopePC-*-win64-portable.zip
```

先只自动上传 portable zip。Inno Setup 安装包可以第二阶段再加入 CI，因为 CI 上安装 Inno Setup 可能需要额外处理。

本地先保证：

```bat
tools\build_portable.bat
tools\package_portable_zip.bat
tools\build_installer.bat
```

都能跑。

